  "_comment": "HSK 2.0 level per headword. Hand-assigned rather than taken from an official file, so treat it as a good approximation and not gospel — the point is that the ordering is roughly right, which is all the scheduler and the estimate need. Words genuinely outside HSK (家庭 vocabulary like 尿布, or Taiwan usages like 白饭) are deliberately absent and stay untagged; claiming a level for them would corrupt the coverage denominator.",
